*> vybe-test: cobol/level_numbers/test_level_77_item
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_numbers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
77 WS-INT PIC 9(3) VALUE 100.
77 WS-STR PIC X(5) VALUE "HELLO".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ADD 50 TO WS-INT.
    DISPLAY WS-INT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-INT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "150"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [150] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-STR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-STR DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

